# Collation (Ruan 1816 KR1h0004; He Yan SBCK KR1h0005), noted where sense-bearing —
#   Ruan: identical in this stretch save the graphic 闚 for 窺 (25). He Yan: 紂之不善也 (20); 如日月之蝕也, 蝕 for
